cnats
------------------------------------------
A C client for the NATS messaging system.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libnats-devel-3.14.0-1bl1
  libnats3.14-3.14.0-1bl1
  libprotobuf-c1-1.5.2-1bl2
  libsodium26-1.0.20-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libprotobuf-c-devel-1.5.2-1bl2
  libsodium-devel-1.0.20-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/nats-io/nats.c

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/nats-io/nats.c/archive/refs/tags/v3.14.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cnats-3.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cnats-3.14.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cnats-3.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cnats-3.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnats3.14-3.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnats-devel-3.14.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cnats)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cnats.README
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/CLAUDE.md
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/GOVERNANCE.md
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/MAINTAINERS.md
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/cnats/dependencies.md

(libnats3.14)
  /usr/bin/cygnats-3.14.dll

(libnats-devel)
  /usr/include/nats.h
  /usr/include/nats/adapters/libevent.h
  /usr/include/nats/adapters/libuv.h
  /usr/include/nats/nats.h
  /usr/include/nats/status.h
  /usr/include/nats/version.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/cnats/cnats-config-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/cnats/cnats-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/cnats/cnats-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/libnats.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libnats.pc

